			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I don't appreciate me, I'm an idiot! Was about to say you're welcome to not have me as a speaker any more 🫣</p><p>I'm happy to be called out - especially when it's super valid because I did a super offensive brainfart like that!</p>",
