			"date": "2024-04-19T16:43:50.408Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@sarajw\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>sarajw</span></a></span> I don’t expect folks to be perfect—we all need a nudge every now and again. It’s what happens after that is the most important and I appreciate you for correcting!</p><p>I also realize that I have an American perspective on gun violence (unfortunately) 😭</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
