			"date": "2024-04-19T16:46:15.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> yeah. And Mormonism - like you probably actually know some good people who are - it's a very alien concept over here - both having such accessible guns and knowing any Mormons.</p><p>Doesn't mean I'm excused. It was a brainfart. Thanks so much for accepting my apology 💜</p>",
