			"date": "2024-04-23T19:28:26.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Hey yoooo</p><p>Just a minor thing, and no rush - I'm she/her rather than they :) I guess I wrote my bio in the 1st person, oops!</p><p>I don't mind 'they', but I feel like that would make people think I identify as trans - and while that's obviously no bad thing, I don't.</p>",
